        <mxCell id="regression-441" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Each &lt;b&gt;row&lt;/b&gt; = one observation (time step), each &lt;b&gt;column&lt;/b&gt; = one feature; the model learns one weight per column&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;In practice: scale features, split train / validation by time (no shuffling for time series) and evaluate on unseen days&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
