        <mxCell id="classification-284" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Feature scaling speeds up convergence;  perfectly separable data makes β grow forever → regularization (C) keeps it finite&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Solvers in practice: lbfgs / newton-cg (second order), saga / SGD for large data (see Optimization page)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
