        <mxCell id="classification-285" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030A0&quot;&gt;❓ Doing this answers:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;After training, where does 'fail' switch to 'pass'?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;→ at x = 2.21 h, where σ(β₀ + β₁x) = 0.5; the loss fell from 0.693 to 0.290 in 60 steps&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EEFB;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
