        <mxCell id="classification-326" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Default threshold 0.5 — move it to trade &lt;b&gt;precision ↔ recall&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;ROC: TPR vs FPR for every threshold;  AUC = P(score of a positive &gt; score of a negative)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Imbalanced data → use F1 / PR-AUC and &lt;b&gt;class_weight&lt;/b&gt;, not accuracy&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Interpretation: \(e^{\beta_j}\) = how the odds multiply when \(x_j\) increases by 1&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
