        <mxCell id="kernel-115" value="&lt;b&gt;Where:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;\(N_k(x)\) = the k training points closest to x (by a distance metric ②)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Weighted variant: closer neighbours vote more, weight \(w_i = 1/d_i\)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No model is learned — all work happens at prediction time&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
