        <mxCell id="dimred-1352" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Exact t-SNE costs O(n²) per iteration; Barnes-Hut / FFT versions make it O(n log n)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Only &lt;b&gt;local&lt;/b&gt; neighbourhoods are preserved: the cost barely cares about far pairs (small pᵢⱼ)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Non-convex: different seeds give different (rotated / rearranged) maps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;This page's t-SNE is a small exact implementation (350 iterations, learning rate 50, adaptive gains)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="690.0" y="3640.0" width="690.0" height="105.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
