        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="association-56" value="&lt;b&gt;Where:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Itemset = any set of items, e.g. {Diaper, Beer};  k-itemset has k items&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;With d items there are \(2^d - 1\) possible itemsets → brute force explodes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Goal&lt;/b&gt;: find all frequent itemsets (support ≥ min support), then rules A → B&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Apriori property&lt;/b&gt;: every subset of a frequent itemset is frequent ⇔ if an itemset is infrequent, all its supersets are infrequent → prune them without counting&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="420.0" y="720.0" width="520.0" height="150.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
