        <mxCell id="association-181" value="&lt;b&gt;Insights:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Confidence is not symmetric: Beer → Diaper = 1.00 but Diaper → Beer = 0.75&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bread → Milk has conf 0.75 but lift &lt; 1 → popular items, not a real association&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Always check lift (or conviction), not confidence alone&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
