        <mxCell id="association-200" value="&lt;b&gt;How the algorithm uses the data:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Apriori never looks at the raw text: it only needs the &lt;b&gt;binary matrix&lt;/b&gt; (item present / absent per basket)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Level k = 1 → keep frequent items → join them into pairs → prune pairs with an infrequent item → count again …&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Highlighted rules have lift &amp;gt; 1.2: the items appear together more often than if they were independent&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rules with lift ≈ 1 (or &amp;lt; 1) are just popular items, not real associations — e.g. anything → {Bread}&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
