        <mxCell id="nlp-107" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Stop-words carry little meaning; optional extra steps: stemming (chased → chase), lemmatization&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Each document becomes a 'bag' — only &lt;b&gt;which&lt;/b&gt; words and &lt;b&gt;how many&lt;/b&gt;, not their order&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
