        <mxCell id="nlp-313" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Limit the vocabulary: &lt;b&gt;max_features&lt;/b&gt;, min_df (drop rare words), max_df (drop very common words)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sparse matrices keep memory small — scikit-learn CountVectorizer returns scipy.sparse&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dense models (neural nets) prefer compact &lt;b&gt;embeddings&lt;/b&gt; (Word2Vec, BERT) instead&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
