        <mxCell id="nlp-346" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Word in every document → idf = log(1) = 0 → ignored (acts like an automatic stop-word list)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rare, specific words get high weight → better features for classification &amp; search&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Same matrix shape and sparsity as BoW — just re-weighted counts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
