        <mxCell id="nlp-380" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Evolution: &lt;b&gt;BoW&lt;/b&gt; → TF-IDF → N-grams → Word2Vec / GloVe (dense meaning) → &lt;b&gt;BERT&lt;/b&gt; (context)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;BoW + TF-IDF remain fast, strong baselines for spam filtering and topic classification&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Your EA pipeline uses BERT for headline sentiment — BoW + Logistic Regression is the baseline to beat&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
