        <mxCell id="rl-68" value="$$\text{MDP} = (S,\ A,\ P(s'\mid s,a),\ R,\ \gamma)$$" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="460.0" y="635.0" width="520.0" height="40.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rl-69" value="&lt;b&gt;Where:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;\(S\) states — what the agent observes (e.g. trend + RSI zone + position)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;\(A\) actions — Buy, Hold, Sell;  \(R\) reward — profit / loss after the action&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;\(P\) transition — how the market moves (unknown → Q-Learning is &lt;b&gt;model-free&lt;/b&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;\(\gamma\) discount — how much future rewards matter (0 → greedy, 1 → far-sighted)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Markov property: the next state depends only on the current state and action&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Goal:&lt;/b&gt; learn a policy \(\pi(s)\) that maximizes total discounted reward&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="420.0" y="685.0" width="360.0" height="190.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rl-70" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030A0&quot;&gt;❓ Doing this answers:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;What must the agent see, do and get back each step?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;→ state s (trend, RSI, position) → action a (Buy / Hold / Sell) → reward r (PnL); γ = how far it plans&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EEFB;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
