        <mxCell id="timeseries-37" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Weak stationarity (constant mean, variance, autocovariance)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Linear dependence on the past&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Residuals are white noise&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Causal |φ| &amp;lt; 1 and invertible MA&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Regular time intervals, no breaks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
