        <mxCell id="timeseries-84" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;AR / MA / ARMA require a stationary series;  test with &lt;b&gt;ADF&lt;/b&gt; (p &amp;lt; 0.05 → stationary)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Differencing d times = the 'I' in ARIMA(p, &lt;b&gt;d&lt;/b&gt;, q);  prices → returns is the same idea&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
