        <mxCell id="timeseries-448" value="Residual ACF: all bars inside the band → white noise ✔" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1170.0" y="1186.0" width="420.0" height="18.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="timeseries-449" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Residuals must look like white noise — otherwise the model missed structure&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ljung-Box&lt;/b&gt; test: p &amp;gt; 0.05 → no autocorrelation left in residuals&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check residuals are roughly normal (histogram / Q-Q plot, see Distributions page)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Workflow (Box-Jenkins): identify → estimate → diagnose → forecast&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1100.0" y="1390.0" width="330.0" height="150.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="timeseries-450" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030A0&quot;&gt;❓ Doing this answers:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Did the model capture all the structure?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;→ yes: no residual ACF bar leaves the band → white noise; φ̂ = 0.779 is close to the true 0.8&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EEFB;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1445.0" y="1392.0" width="235.0" height="82.0" as="geometry" />
