        <mxCell id="optimization-81" value="$$f'(\theta) = \lim_{h\to 0}\frac{f(\theta+h)-f(\theta)}{h}$$" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="440.0" y="670.0" width="560.0" height="50.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="optimization-82" value="$$\theta := \theta - \alpha\, f'(\theta)$$" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="440.0" y="720.0" width="560.0" height="40.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="optimization-83" value="&lt;b&gt;Idea:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;The derivative is the slope of the tangent line at the current θ&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Subtracting \(\alpha f'(\theta)\) always moves &lt;b&gt;downhill&lt;/b&gt;, opposite to the slope&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Step size shrinks automatically as the slope flattens near the minimum&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="420.0" y="770.0" width="330.0" height="100.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="optimization-84" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030A0&quot;&gt;❓ Doing this answers:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Which way should θ move, and how far?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;→ opposite to the slope: f′(θ) &gt; 0 → decrease θ; steps shrink as the slope → 0 at the minimum&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EEFB;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="760.0" y="765.0" width="260.0" height="68.0" as="geometry" />
