        <mxCell id="optimization-333" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules of thumb:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Plot J every iteration: it must &lt;b&gt;decrease every step&lt;/b&gt; (for batch GD)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Try α on a log scale: 0.001, 0.003, 0.01, 0.03, 0.1, 0.3, 1&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Learning-rate schedules: step decay, \(\alpha_t = \frac{\alpha_0}{1+kt}\), cosine, warm-up&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Early stopping: stop when the &lt;b&gt;validation&lt;/b&gt; loss starts to rise (overfitting)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
