        <mxCell id="statistics-611" value="&lt;b&gt;LLN vs CLT:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;LLN&lt;/b&gt;: the sample mean x̄ converges to μ as n grows (about the &lt;i&gt;value&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;CLT&lt;/b&gt;: the &lt;i&gt;distribution&lt;/i&gt; of x̄ around μ is normal with spread SE = σ/√n&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
