        <mxCell id="datanature-149" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;ID&lt;/b&gt; is not a feature — it carries no pattern (and can leak information); drop it before training&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Datetime&lt;/b&gt; → index for time series, or extract features (day-of-week, month, hour)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Qualitative columns (Sector, Rating, Trend) must be &lt;b&gt;encoded&lt;/b&gt; before most ML algorithms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Binary target → classification; continuous target (e.g. Return %) → regression&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
