        <mxCell id="datanature-632" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030A0&quot;&gt;❓ Doing this answers:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;How do I measure the link between two numeric columns?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;→ Pearson r if linear, Spearman ρ if monotonic, MI for any shape (see ④)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EEFB;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="598.0" y="1885.0" width="444.0" height="54.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
