        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="datanature-637" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;All measures lie in [0, 1] (V, η², MI ≥ 0) or [−1, 1] (r, ρ, τ, r_pb): 0 = no association&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The matching hypothesis test for each cell is on the &lt;b&gt;Hypothesis Tests by Data Type&lt;/b&gt; page&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Feature selection: use these to rank features against the target (filter methods)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
