        <mxCell id="datanature-714" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030A0&quot;&gt;❓ Doing this answers:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Why is 95 % accuracy useless on this table?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;→ always predicting class 0 already scores 95 % → judge the rare class with precision / recall / F1&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EEFB;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
