        <mxCell id="hypotests-430" value="&lt;b&gt;Interpretation:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;F = 11.53 &gt; 3.68 (p = 0.00093) → at least one strategy mean differs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;ANOVA does not say &lt;i&gt;which&lt;/i&gt; one → post-hoc &lt;b&gt;Tukey HSD&lt;/b&gt; (or Bonferroni pairwise t-tests)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Assumptions: normal residuals, equal variances (Levene), independent groups; else Welch ANOVA / Kruskal-Wallis&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Same subjects in every group → repeated-measures ANOVA (non-parametric: Friedman)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
