        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="labelling-72" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Timeframe&lt;/b&gt; = bar size (1m, 1h, 1d); &lt;b&gt;period&lt;/b&gt; = how much history (e.g. 1 week of 1m bars)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Each row = one time step t; features: values up to t; label: outcome over (t, t+h]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The last h rows have no label → drop them (they would need future data)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Never shuffle before splitting: train on the past, test on the future (see ⑥)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
