        <mxCell id="labelling-236" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Simple and the most common labelling in papers (classification of the next-h-bar move)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Better: dynamic threshold τₜ = k·σₜ (volatility-scaled)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Best: take the path into account → &lt;b&gt;Triple Barrier Method&lt;/b&gt; ④&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Assumes non-overlapping, independent labels — usually false (see ⑥)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
