        <mxCell id="evaluation-373" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;ROC: TPR vs FPR over all thresholds; AUC = P(random positive scores higher than random negative)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;With many negatives, a small FPR still means many false alarms → ROC looks great, PR shows the truth&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Prefer &lt;b&gt;PR-AUC / AP&lt;/b&gt; for rare events (crashes, fraud); ROC-AUC for balanced classes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pick the operating threshold afterwards from cost of FP vs FN (red point)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
