        <mxCell id="explain-84" value="&lt;b&gt;Why bother:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Trust&lt;/b&gt;: does the model use sensible signals (trend, momentum) or noise?&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Debug&lt;/b&gt;: a 'too important' feature often reveals &lt;b&gt;data leakage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Feature selection&lt;/b&gt;: drop features with ~0 importance → simpler, more robust model&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Communicate&lt;/b&gt;: explain each trade signal to stakeholders / regulators&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
