        <mxCell id="explain-405" value="The colour changes &lt;b&gt;faster along EMA_gap when volatility is high&lt;/b&gt; → the effect of the trend depends on volatility (interaction the data was built with: 1.3·EMA·Vol)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
