        <mxCell id="explain-637" value="← lowers P(up)          SHAP value          raises P(up) →" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1250.0" y="2354.0" width="370.0" height="16.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="explain-638" value="blue = low feature value · red = high feature value" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1250.0" y="2370.0" width="370.0" height="16.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="explain-639" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Guarantees: &lt;b&gt;efficiency&lt;/b&gt; (sums to f(x) − E[f]), symmetry, dummy (unused feature → 0)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Exact cost: 2&lt;sup&gt;p&lt;/sup&gt; coalitions → KernelSHAP samples them; &lt;b&gt;TreeSHAP&lt;/b&gt; is exact &amp;amp; fast for trees&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Global importance = mean |φ_j| over many rows (top-to-bottom order of the beeswarm)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;High RSI (red dots) sits on the left → overbought lowers P(up); high EMA_gap on the right&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Correlated features share credit (RSI vs RSI_copy) — same caution as ③&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="420.0" y="2200.0" width="660.0" height="125.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
