        <mxCell id="versatile-2933" value="φ̂ = 0.46; residual eₜ = rₜ − φ̂rₜ₋₁; &lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt; alerts beyond ±3σ (injected shocks at t = 45, 98, 130)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1470.0" y="2285.0" width="430.0" height="34.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2934" value="(d) Apriori: indicators that fire together" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1940.0" y="2080.0" width="440.0" height="20.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2935" value="&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10px&quot; border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#EEEEEE&quot;&gt;&lt;th&gt;rule (→ bounce within 5 bars)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;support&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;confidence&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;lift&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;{RSI &amp;lt; 30}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;0.078&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;0.66&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1.84&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;{Close &amp;lt; lower BB}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;0.077&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;0.66&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1.85&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#FFFF00&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;{RSI &amp;lt; 30, Close &amp;lt; lower BB}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;0.057&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;0.77&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2.15&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1940.0" y="2114.0" width="440.0" height="95.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2936" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;1,000 simulated days; base bounce rate 0.36&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Each indicator condition = an 'item', each day = a 'basket'&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The pair has the highest confidence &amp; lift → candidate rule for a strategy (validate out-of-sample!)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1940.0" y="2220.0" width="440.0" height="63.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2937" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=0.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=default;spacing=4;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="400.0" y="2430.0" width="2000.0" height="360.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2938" value="⑦ Summary: familiar algorithms, hidden jobs" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="414.0" y="2440.0" width="1972.0" height="26.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2939" value="&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px&quot; border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#EEEEEE&quot;&gt;&lt;th&gt;Algorithm&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Usual job&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Hidden use(s)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Why it works&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#FFFF00&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;★ k-Nearest Neighbors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;classification / regression&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;pixel inpainting, KNN imputer, anomaly score, recommendation&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;nearby points (pixels, rows) are similar&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;K-Means&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;clustering&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;colour quantization, compression, cluster features, regime labels&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;centroid = best single representative of a group&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;PCA&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;dimensionality reduction&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;denoising, eigen-images, decorrelation, factor models&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;signal concentrates in few directions, noise spreads over all&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Decision tree&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;classification&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;surrogate explanations, rule extraction, supervised binning&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;axis-aligned rules are human readable&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Random forest&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;classification / regression&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;proximity imputation &amp; outliers, uncertainty from tree spread&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;rows sharing leaves are similar for the target&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Autoencoder (MLP)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;representation learning&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;anomaly detection, denoising, compression&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;it only learns to rebuild 'normal' patterns&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Logistic regression&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;binary classification&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Platt calibration, meta-label bet sizing, propensity scores&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;maps any score to a probability&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Linear regression / Z-score / ARMA&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;prediction / standardization / forecasting&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;hedge ratio, mean-reversion entries, residual alerts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;deviations from a fitted relation are informative&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Apriori&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;market-basket rules&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;co-firing indicator rules, log-pattern mining&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;support / confidence / lift work on any set of events&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="420.0" y="2480.0" width="1960.0" height="215.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2940" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Every hidden use must still be &lt;b&gt;validated&lt;/b&gt;: hide known values (pixels, cells, labels) and measure how well the trick recovers them&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;These tricks also appear as the green '💡 Also used for' box in the left column of every algorithm page&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="420.0" y="2715.0" width="1960.0" height="46.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2941" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030A0&quot;&gt;❓ Doing this answers:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;What colour should the missing pixel be?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;→ the average of its 4 nearest known pixels → RGB (101, 172, 100), close to the true green (70, 160, 60)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EEFB;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="440.0" y="760.0" width="560.0" height="54.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2942" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;endFill=1;endSize=6;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1000.0" y="760.0" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1478.0" y="685.0" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2943" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030A0&quot;&gt;❓ Doing this answers:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Is kNN better than filling with the column mean?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;→ yes here: error 0.62σ vs 0.78σ, because it uses how the columns relate&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EEFB;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1763.0" y="896.0" width="600.0" height="51.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2944" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;endFill=1;endSize=6;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2104.0" y="896.0" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2104.0" y="773.0" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2945" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030A0&quot;&gt;❓ Doing this answers:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;How few colours can I keep before the image looks wrong?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;→ k = 4: 12× smaller with colour MSE 186; k = 2 loses the sun (MSE 1516)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EEFB;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="890.0" y="1560.0" width="490.0" height="54.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2946" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;endFill=1;endSize=6;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="890.0" y="1560.0" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="818.0" y="1243.0" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2947" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030A0&quot;&gt;❓ Doing this answers:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;How many components hold the real signal?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;→ k = 2: error drops 0.201 → 0.024 (88 % less noise); extra components add noise back&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EEFB;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2165.0" y="1460.0" width="225.0" height="68.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2948" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;endFill=1;endSize=6;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2165.0" y="1460.0" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2155.0" y="1304.0" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2949" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030A0&quot;&gt;❓ Doing this answers:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Can simple rules explain what the black box does?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;→ yes: a depth-2 tree reproduces 88 % of its predictions&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EEFB;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430.0" y="1995.0" width="470.0" height="54.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2950" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;endFill=1;endSize=6;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="831.0" y="1995.0" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="831.0" y="1947.0" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2951" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030A0&quot;&gt;❓ Doing this answers:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Do these two indicators predict a bounce better together?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;→ yes: RSI &amp;lt; 30 &amp;amp; Close &amp;lt; lower BB → confidence 0.77, lift 2.15 vs ~1.85 alone; validate out-of-sample&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EEFB;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1950.0" y="2290.0" width="420.0" height="68.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2952" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;endFill=1;endSize=6;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2283.0" y="2290.0" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2283.0" y="2186.0" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2953" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030A0&quot;&gt;❓ Doing this answers:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Why does an algorithm work outside its usual job?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;→ the hidden use relies on the same core idea, e.g. nearby points are similar, centroids summarise groups&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EEFB;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="440.0" y="2500.0" width="430.0" height="68.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="versatile-2954" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;endFill=1;endSize=6;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="870.0" y="2534.0" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="999.0" y="2516.0" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
