        <mxCell id="recsys-208" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Needs no other users → works for &lt;b&gt;new items&lt;/b&gt; (item cold start) as soon as they have a description&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Over-specialisation: only recommends 'more of the same' (filter bubble); no serendipity&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bag-of-Words / TF-IDF details: NLP page; embeddings (Word2Vec, BERT) capture synonyms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
